      "writtenOn": "2016-11-17T00:03:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Prefer to place this outside the switch, and remove the |default| case. Rationale: if there\u0027s no default case, the compiler can warn us about missing enum values. If there _is_ a default case, the compiler no longer considers any values missing.",
