      "writtenOn": "2016-11-17T00:03:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Consider prefacing this line, with an assertion that uint32_t is big enough.\n\n  static_assert(sizeof(uint32_t) \u003e\u003d sizeof(wifi_channel), \"some error message\");\n\nThat would make it clearer that the cast at line 324 is safe. (Well, safe is we\u0027re compiling with -fno-strict-aliasing, at least.)",
      "revId": "3b0b2f8a2b93a8e76663406c27575b4eba76db26",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
