        "id": 1081399
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-11-17T00:03:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would prefer to have this limit expressed in terms of total-size, rather than per-element size. That would make the full computation explicit.\n\n  static_assert(sizeof(...) * kMaxCachedGscanResults \u003c kStackAllocLimitBytes, ...);\n\nOr, if you place the assertion after the declaration:\n\n  static_assert(sizeof(scan_results) \u003c kStackAllocLimitBytes, ...);",
      "revId": "3b0b2f8a2b93a8e76663406c27575b4eba76db26",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
